[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8656.469, "timestamp": "02:24:16", "text": "东西。兄弟，这片区域已经满了。 打扫干净了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8659.27, "timestamp": "02:24:19", "text": "大家都把东西买光了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8662.07, "timestamp": "02:24:22", "text": "但是还剩下一些面条。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8664.15, "timestamp": "02:24:24", "text": "哦，我得用微波炉加热一下。天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8666.63, "timestamp": "02:24:26", "text": "寿司还没吃完。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8669.91, "timestamp": "02:24:29", "text": "等等，这里什么都没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8673.84, "timestamp": "02:24:33", "text": "这里什么都没有。 一些沙拉。泡菜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8677.12, "timestamp": "02:24:37", "text": "一些沙拉。泡菜。 日式泡菜味道怪怪的。我更"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8680.24, "timestamp": "02:24:40", "text": "日式泡菜味道怪怪的。我更 喜欢……我觉得韩式泡菜更好吃。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8689.19, "timestamp": "02:24:49", "text": "天哪，这里什么都没有。不过我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8692.23, "timestamp": "02:24:52", "text": "买个甜点。"}]